    "If OneDrive was disconnected, start it and retry. Your cloud copy remains unchanged." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果 OneDrive 已断开，请启动后重试。云端副本不会被更改。" } } } },
